"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/b32df3f2e80ca1a05bcb4ed088459fb7.poster.avif?t=1752718807\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/b32df3f2e80ca1a05bcb4ed088459fb7.webm?t=1752718807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/b32df3f2e80ca1a05bcb4ed088459fb7.mp4?t=1752718807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Psycho-Thriller Horror Between Reality and Delusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things start feeling off, your memories become foggy, and Reina still holds onto a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is what you see real? Is it your mind playing tricks on you? Tokyo's rain washes the truth away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/2b0322dc817f5e66f9e5e292119301ba.poster.avif?t=1752718807\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/2b0322dc817f5e66f9e5e292119301ba.webm?t=1752718807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/2b0322dc817f5e66f9e5e292119301ba.mp4?t=1752718807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kick Back with Rain98's Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole range of chill lo-fi tunes will fill your room with nostalgy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with the sound effects of the surrounding environment, they'll transport you straight into the '90s.</p>",
